{"sectionId":"organic_rxn/enolate","items":[{"id":"organic_rxn--enolate-k001","sectionId":"organic_rxn/enolate","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"carbonyl α-H는 enolate의 공명 안정화 때문에 상대적으로 산성이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--enolate-k002","sectionId":"organic_rxn/enolate","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"keto-enol tautomerism은 proton 위치와 이중결합 위치가 달라지는 구조 이성질체 간 평형이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--enolate-k003","sectionId":"organic_rxn/enolate","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"강하고 bulky한 염기(LDA 등)를 낮은 온도에서 쓰면 덜 치환된 kinetic enolate가 우세할 수 있고 평형 조건에서는 더 안정한 thermodynamic enolate가 유리할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--enolate-k004","sectionId":"organic_rxn/enolate","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"enolate는 탄소 또는 산소를 통해 친핵체로 반응할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--enolate-k005","sectionId":"organic_rxn/enolate","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"aldol 반응에서 enolate가 aldehyde/ketone에 첨가해 β-hydroxy carbonyl을 만들고 탈수 시 α,β-unsaturated carbonyl이 형성될 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--enolate-k006","sectionId":"organic_rxn/enolate","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"Claisen condensation은 ester enolate의 acyl substitution으로 β-keto ester를 만들며 보통 생성물의 산성 proton 제거가 평형을 구동한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--enolate-k007","sectionId":"organic_rxn/enolate","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"crossed aldol은 여러 enolate 및 carbonyl 조합을 고려해야 한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--enolate-k008","sectionId":"organic_rxn/enolate","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"α-halogenation은 산성·염기성 조건에 따라 다중 치환 가능성이 다르다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--enolate-k009","sectionId":"organic_rxn/enolate","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"Michael addition은 공액 carbonyl의 β탄소에 1,4 첨가하는 대표 반응이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--enolate-k010","sectionId":"organic_rxn/enolate","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"aldol 첨가 생성물: β-hydroxy carbonyl.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--enolate-k011","sectionId":"organic_rxn/enolate","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"Claisen 생성물: β-keto ester의 대표 구조.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--enolate-k012","sectionId":"organic_rxn/enolate","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"tautomer와 resonance contributor는 다르다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--enolate-k013","sectionId":"organic_rxn/enolate",